  <Intro>k__BackingField: A horde marches on its stomach, and the border barons keep the granaries. Gold buys grain, and grain buys loyalty. Fill the war chest before the winter moon.
  <Outro>k__BackingField: The war chest is full. For the first time in a generation every clan eats, and every clan listens.
